"to unsafe pointer code on a Xeon E5-1650v3. 64 byte unrolling was slightly better for","large inputs but significantly worse for 50-byte input, unsurprisingly. I suspect","that it's a not uncommon use case to encode smallish chunks of data (e.g. a 64-byte","SHA-512 digest), so it would be nice if that fit in the unrolled loop at least once.","Plus, single-digit percentage performance differences might well be quite different","on different hardware."]],[232,["Encode what's left after the fast loop."]],[239,["start at the first index not handled by fast loop, which may be 0."]]]}}},{"def_id":50,"item_meta":{"name":[{"Ident":["base64",0]},{"Ident":["engine",0]},{"Ident":["general_purpose",0]},{"Impl":{"Trait":6}},{"Ident":["internal_decode",0]},{"Impl":{"Trait":10}},{"Ident":["call_once",0]}],"span":{"Untagged":{"data":{"file_id":5,"beg":{"line":108,"col":12},"end":{"line":108,"col":28}},"generated_from_span":null}},"source_text":"|_, _, _| (0, 0)","attr_info":{"attributes":[],"inline":null,"rename":null,"public":false},"is_local":true,"started_from":false,"is_extern":false,"opacity":"Transparent","lang_item":null,"diagnostic_item":null,"has_errors":false},"generics":{"regions":[{"index":0,"name":null,"variance":"Covariant","mutability":"Unknown"},{"index":1,"name":null,"variance":"Covariant","mutability":"Unknown"}],"types":[],"const_generics":[],"trait_clauses":[],"regions_outlive":[],"types_outlive":[],"trait_type_constraints":[]},"signature":{"is_unsafe":false,"abi":"Rust","is_variadic":false,"inputs":[{"Deduplicated":74},{"Value":[235,{"Adt":{"id":0,"generics":{"regions":[],"types":[{"Deduplicated":127},{"Deduplicated":0},{"Deduplicated":92}],"const_generics":[],"trait_refs":[]},"builtin":"Tuple"}}]}],"output":{"Deduplicated":29}},"src":{"TraitImpl":{"impl_ref":{"id":10,"generics":{"regions":[{"Var":{"Free":0}},{"Var":{"Free":1}}],"types":[],"const_generics":[],"trait_refs":[]}},"trait_ref":{"id":10,"generics":{"regions":[],"types":[{"Deduplicated":74},{"Dedupli